{"id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-iterated-consistency.md","title":"Finite Consistency Iterates","display":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Consistency Iterates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-iterated-consistency","aliases":["67-df-iterated-consistency"],"display":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Consistency Iterates","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-proof-representation]]","[[67-df-consistency-statement]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"Con(n,S), Con_S^omega","source_printed_pages":"54–55","source_pdf_pages":"65–66","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-iterated-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-iterated-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Consistency Iterates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Con(n,S), Con_S^omega"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"54–55"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"65–66"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 固定 PR 公理呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_S=(0,e_S)\">\\(E_S=(0,e_S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)\">\\(\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span> 及所有句法程序固定不变。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 与加句公式取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>。在本条及其迭代中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span> 以此表示绑定到 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是公理代码变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{S;\\theta}\">\\(\\sigma_{S;\\theta}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n(S)\">\\(C_n(S)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；加句步骤始终以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_S\">\\(\\sigma_S\\)</span> 为基础，不在递归时重新选择公理表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{S;\\theta}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\theta)},\\\\\nC_1(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_S},\\\\\nC_{n+1}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{S;C_n(S)}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C_n(S):n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{S;\\theta}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\theta)},\\\\\nC_1(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_S},\\\\\nC_{n+1}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{S;C_n(S)}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C_n(S):n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>忠实采用原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(n+1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}(1,S+\\mathrm{Con}(n,S))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(n+1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}(1,S+\\mathrm{Con}(n,S))\\)</span> 的递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 在这里是全体有限次迭代的集合，不额外引入一个对象语言无限合取。</p>\n<p>这不同于有限公理片段的一致性：迭代每次对加上前一一致性句的整个呈示取一致性。递归按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 良基，固定呈示使每步句子唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 固定 PR 公理呈示 $E_S=(0,e_S)$；$\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)$ 取 [[67-df-proof-representation]]。$g=c_{L_A}$、$D,\\gamma$ 及所有句法程序固定不变。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma$、$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 与加句公式取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]。在本条及其迭代中，$\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}$，$\\mathrm{Con}_S$ 以此表示绑定到 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma$、$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 与加句公式取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]。在本条及其迭代中，$\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}$，$\\mathrm{Con}_S$ 以此表示绑定到 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"E_S=(0,e_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_S(z)=D_{e_S}(z,1)","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"D,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S=\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\sigma_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{S;\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_{S;\\theta}(z)&\\coloneqq\\sigma_S(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\theta)},\\\\\nC_1(S)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_S},\\\\\nC_{n+1}(S)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{S;C_n(S)}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\omega}(S)&\\coloneqq\\{C_n(S):n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(n+1,S)=\\mathrm{Con}(1,S+\\mathrm{Con}(n,S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2595,"backlinks":[{"id":"b788e7e6ee61a0b2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 为固定 PR 呈示，$C_n(S)$ 